>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">叱る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しかる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">斥责；训斥；责骂；谴责</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195319\">ママに<ruby>叱<rp>(</rp><rt>しか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られますよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你会从妈妈那里拿到的</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">式</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">方式；风格；样式；方法；体制；形式；类型；仪式；仪礼；典礼；庆典；婚礼；婚礼仪式；方程式；公式；表达式；（律令法的）施行细则</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105373\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>事故<rp>(</rp><rt>じこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でその<ruby>式<rp>(</rp><rt>しき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>出席<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一场事故禁止他参加仪式</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">支給</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しきゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">供给；供应；支付；津贴；补助</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165569\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>制服<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>支給<rp>(</rp><rt>しきゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们得到了制服。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-h